          "id": "B",
          "text": "Star Schema, because every composite key is a fact table"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3NF, because ProductName determines the primary key"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2NF, because a non-key attribute depends on only part of the composite key"
